    "raw": "<!-- wp:html -->\n<!-- content-architecture-2026:about -->\n<style>\n.aurora-about-page :where(p, li)::first-letter {\n  initial-letter: normal !important;\n  font-size: inherit !important;\n  font-weight: inherit !important;\n  float: none !important;\n  margin: 0 !important;\n  line-height: inherit !important;\n  color: inherit !important;\n  background: transparent !important;\n}\n.aurora-about-page .aurora-button,\n.aurora-about-page a.aurora-button {\n  display: inline-block;\n  padding: 0.7rem 1.1rem;\n  border: 1px solid #171310;\n  border-radius: 2px;\n  background: #171310;\n  color: #efe6d2 !important;\n  font-size: 0.72rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  letter-spacing: 0.12em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  text-decoration: none !important;\n}\n.aurora-about-page .aurora-button:hover,\n.aurora-about-page a.aurora-button:hover {\n  background: #d94a1f;\n  border-color: #d94a1f;\n  color: #efe6d2 !important;\n  text-decoration: none !important;\n}\n.aurora-about-page .aurora-button-ghost,\n.aurora-about-page a.aurora-button-ghost {\n  background: transparent;\n  color: #171310 !important;\n}\n.aurora-about-page .aurora-button-ghost:hover,\n.aurora-about-page a.aurora-button-ghost:hover {\n  background: #171310;\n  border-color: #171310;\n  color: #efe6d2 !important;\n}\n.aurora-about-page .aurora-card,\n.aurora-about-page .aurora-media-card {\n  border-radius: 2px !important;\n  box-shadow: none !important;\n}\n.aurora-about-page .aurora-about-hero {\n  display: grid;\n  gap: clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 2.75rem);\n  margin: 0 0 clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.5rem);\n}\n.aurora-about-page .aurora-about-hero-media {\n  margin: 0;\n  border-radius: 2px;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  background: #171310;\n}\n.aurora-about-page .aurora-about-hero-media img {\n  display: block;\n  width: 100%;\n  height: clamp(320px, 62vh, 720px);\n  object-fit: cover;\n  object-position: 50% 28%;\n}\n.aurora-about-page .aurora-about-hero-copy {\n  max-width: 72ch;\n}\n.aurora-about-page .aurora-about-hero-copy .aurora-action-row {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\n  gap: 0.75rem;\n  margin-top: 1.35rem;\n}\n@media (min-width: 900px) {\n  .aurora-about-page .aurora-about-hero {\n    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.05fr) minmax(0, 1fr);\n    align-items: end;\n    gap: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3.5rem);\n  }\n  .aurora-about-page .aurora-about-hero-media img {\n    height: clamp(420px, 68vh, 760px);\n  }\n}\n</style>\n<div class=\"aurora-about-page\">\n<section class=\"aurora-about-hero\" aria-labelledby=\"aurora-about-title\">\n  <figure class=\"aurora-about-hero-media\">\n    <img src=\"https://i0.wp.com/kriskrug.co/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/krug-1.jpg?w=2000&amp;ssl=1\"\n      srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/kriskrug.co/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/krug-1.jpg?w=640&amp;ssl=1 640w, https://i0.wp.com/kriskrug.co/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/krug-1.jpg?w=960&amp;ssl=1 960w, https://i0.wp.com/kriskrug.co/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/krug-1.jpg?w=1280&amp;ssl=1 1280w, https://i0.wp.com/kriskrug.co/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/krug-1.jpg?w=1600&amp;ssl=1 1600w, https://i0.wp.com/kriskrug.co/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/krug-1.jpg?w=2000&amp;ssl=1 2000w\"\n      sizes=\"(min-width: 900px) 48vw, 100vw\"\n      alt=\"Portrait of Kris Krüg\"\n      width=\"2000\"\n      height=\"1827\"\n      fetchpriority=\"high\"\n      decoding=\"async\"/>\n  </figure>\n  <div class=\"aurora-about-hero-copy\">\n    <p class=\"aurora-section-kicker\">About</p>\n    <h2 id=\"aurora-about-title\" class=\"aurora-display-heading\">I build culture around emerging technology.</h2>\n    <p class=\"aurora-page-lead\">I am Kris Krug: photographer, creative technologist, community builder, speaker, and field-note person for the weird edge where humans meet the machines they keep inventing.</p>\n    <p>I have spent two decades documenting technology, art, activism, conferences, communities, and the back rooms where culture actually changes. These days, most of that work points at one question: how do we use AI to increase human capacity instead of flattening human judgment?</p>\n    <div class=\"aurora-action-row\">\n      <a class=\"aurora-button\" href=\"/contact/\">Contact Kris</a>\n      <a class=\"aurora-button aurora-button-ghost\" href=\"/work/\">See the work</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"aurora-proof-section\">\n  <p class=\"aurora-section-kicker\">The rooms I am in now</p>\n  <div class=\"aurora-proof-grid\">\n    <article class=\"aurora-media-card\">\n      <a href=\"https://bc-ai.ca/\">\n        <img src=\"https://i0.wp.com/bc-ai.ca/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/bcai-living-ecosystem.webp?w=1200&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"BC plus AI ecosystem graphic\" loading=\"lazy\"/>\n        <div>\n          <h3>BC + AI Ecosystem</h3>\n          <p>Building grassroots AI literacy, events, and community infrastructure across British Columbia.</p>\n        </div>\n      </a>\n    </article>\n    <article class=\"aurora-media-card\">\n      <a href=\"/speaking/\">\n        <img src=\"https://i0.wp.com/kriskrug.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/kk-cmvan-keynote-header.png?w=1280&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"Punk Rock AI CreativeMornings Vancouver keynote banner\" loading=\"lazy\"/>\n        <div>\n          <h3>AI keynotes and workshops</h3>\n          <p>Helping audiences understand AI through taste, courage, responsibility, and useful live demos.</p>\n        </div>\n      </a>\n    </article>\n    <article class=\"aurora-media-card\">\n      <a href=\"/photography/\">\n        <img src=\"https://i0.wp.com/kriskrug.co/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/20067931301_e7a16b6f2c_k-1.jpg?w=1200&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"Archive photograph from Kris Krug photography practice\" loading=\"lazy\"/>\n        <div>\n          <h3>Visual storytelling</h3>\n          <p>A long public archive of people, movements, music, technology, and the strange theatre of modern life.</p>\n        </div>\n      </a>\n    </article>\n    <article class=\"aurora-media-card\">\n      <a href=\"/work/\">\n        <img src=\"https://www.bothhandsfull.com/opengraph-image?46af5f0ff830fe03\" alt=\"Both Hands Full keynote graphic\" loading=\"lazy\"/>\n        <div>\n          <h3>Creative AI systems</h3>\n          <p>Projects, publishing loops, and experiments for staying distinct in the synthetic age.</p>\n        </div>\n      </a>\n    </article>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"aurora-proof-section\">\n  <p class=\"aurora-section-kicker\">Public trail</p>\n  <div class=\"aurora-proof-grid\">\n    <article class=\"aurora-card\">\n      <h3>A two-decade public trail</h3>\n      <p>National Geographic, CBC, Rolling Stone-adjacent rooms, TEDxOilSpill, Midway Journey, SXSW, the Olympics, and many smaller rooms that mattered just as much.</p>\n    </article>\n    <article class=\"aurora-card\">\n      <h3>Community before platform</h3>\n      <p>The durable work is not the tool. It is the people, rituals, trust, and shared language that let people build together.</p>\n    </article>\n    <article class=\"aurora-card\">\n      <h3>Receipts over adjectives</h3>\n      <p>I would rather show the work, name the collaborators, and leave a trail than inflate a bio until it floats away.</p>\n    </article>\n    <article class=\"aurora-card\">\n      <h3>Human capacity</h3>\n      <p>The point of AI is not to become less human faster. The point is to make more room for judgment, care, imagination, and courage.</p>\n    </article>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"aurora-proof-section\">\n  <div class=\"aurora-card\">\n    <h2>Start with the work</h2>\n    <p>For projects, talks, workshops, interviews, and collaborations, the best next step is to tell me what kind of room you want to build.</p>\n    <p><a class=\"aurora-button\" href=\"/contact/\">Contact Kris</a></p>\n  </div>\n</section>\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:html -->\n",
